    <ChangeLog Date="2025-03-31 16:30:00" Version="7.0.7">#BugFix - Update Core.UI.Table.js and Core.Agent.Admin.js, for the filter field to work correctly, both when clicking on Show Valid and Show All.</ChangeLog>
    <ChangeLog Date="2025-01-28 11:00:00" Version="7.0.6">#Added - Update Core.UI.Table.js to Show Valid not filter invalids and bugfix on customer login url.</ChangeLog>
    <ChangeLog Date="2024-11-27 08:25:00" Version="7.0.5">#BugFix - Update JS InboxCore, split form action</ChangeLog>
    <ChangeLog Date="2024-10-30 12:00:00" Version="7.0.4">#BugFix - Update JS InboxCore, fixed redirect login</ChangeLog>
    <ChangeLog Date="2024-07-00 14:30:00" Version="7.0.3">#BugFix - Update JS version to jsGant</ChangeLog>
    <ChangeLog Date="2023-07-01 14:30:00" Version="7.0.2">Correction of function that adds css and js</ChangeLog>
    <ChangeLog Date="2023-09-12 16:00:00" Version="7.0.1">First version znuny7</ChangeLog>
    <Description Lang="en">Module assembles third party APIs used in various modules</Description>
    <Description Lang="pt_BR">Módulo reúne APIs de terceiro utilizados em diversos módulos.</Description>
    <Framework>7.x.x</Framework>
    <IntroInstall Lang="en" Title="Install Information" Type="pre">
        &lt;br&gt;
        &lt;strong&gt;WELCOME&lt;/strong&gt;
        &lt;br&gt;
        &lt;br&gt;

        You are about to install the package InBox Core.
        &lt;br&gt;
